  "manifest_sha256": "7294e3edcd3468aeb8881182f77a3f22c9d9de41dff1dba8f183e9fe1753c9a7",
  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nHow many cups of clay does each student need for one dish? Jada makes three times as many clay dishes as Rory. Rory makes 22 more clay dishes than Kora. Each clay dish requires 2 cups of clay.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "EXACT PUBLIC STATE AFTER TURN 1; NO PRIVATE OR FUTURE DATA\nPUBLIC_STATE_JSON:\n{\"completed_task_turns\":[{\"turn\":1,\"user_message\":\"Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\\\boxed{}.\\n\\nHow many cups of clay does each student need for one dish? Jada makes three times as many clay dishes as Rory. Rory makes 22 more clay dishes than Kora. Each clay dish requires 2 cups of clay.\"}],\"public_metadata\":{\"benchmark\":\"Evolving Intent GSM8K\",\"upstream_commit\":\"993d6be9597ac03854b46362ccd647eb1bfd267a\"}}",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Wait, I made a mistake. Jada makes twice as many clay dishes as Rory.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Each clay dish requires **2 cups of clay**, regardless of how many dishes each student makes.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\text{ cups}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. Rory makes 20 more clay dishes than Kora.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The number of dishes each student makes does not affect the amount of clay needed for **one dish**. Each dish requires 2 cups.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\text{ cups}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh, I forgot to mention: Kora makes 20 clay dishes.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Kora makes 20 dishes, so Rory makes:\n\n\\[\n20+20=40\\text{ dishes}\n\\]\n\nJada makes twice as many as Rory:\n\n\\[\n2\\times40=80\\text{ dishes}\n\\]\n\nHowever, **each dish requires 2 cups of clay**, so each student needs:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\text{ cups of clay per dish}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Great. Now let's take that a step further. How many total clay dishes do Jada and Rory make together?",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Kora makes 20 dishes, so Rory makes:\n\n\\[\n20+20=40\\text{ dishes}\n\\]\n\nJada makes twice as many as Rory:\n\n\\[\n2\\times 40=80\\text{ dishes}\n\\]\n\nTogether, Jada and Rory make:\n\n\\[\n80+40=\\boxed{120\\text{ clay dishes}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "I should also tell you: Jada, Rory, and Kora make clay dishes for their school art project.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "That context does not change the calculation. Jada and Rory make:\n\n\\[\n80+40=\\boxed{120\\text{ clay dishes}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Good, now using that, can you calculate: How many clay dishes do Jada, Rory, and Kora make together?",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Kora makes 20 dishes.\n\nRory makes 20 more than Kora:\n\n\\[\n20+20=40\n\\]\n\nJada makes twice as many as Rory:\n\n\\[\n2\\times40=80\n\\]\n\nTogether, they make:\n\n\\[\n80+40+20=\\boxed{140\\text{ clay dishes}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
